              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او با دیدن هدیه ذوق کرد. u bâ didan-e hediye zowq kard. He was thrilled when he saw the present."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "zowq 'delight; taste, flair' + kardan. Warm and colloquial."
            }
          ]
